      "y": 700,
      "width": 447.5999999999999,
      "height": 45,
      "text": "An App delegates a nested App at a splat route. boundaryAboveSplat strips\nthe remainder, so reports is mounted at /operations/reports and never\nlearns whether it was reached on its own or inside another App.",
      "originalText": "An App delegates a nested App at a splat route. boundaryAboveSplat strips\nthe remainder, so reports is mounted at /operations/reports and never\nlearns whether it was reached on its own or inside another App.",
